__HIDDENCAT__
A maintenance tracking category for a page whose template did not get what it
needed and drew something else instead. Every template that can tell puts a page
here, rather than each keeping a category of its own: what a reader of the
category wants is the list of pages to look at, not which template it was.

Defining it as a hidden category keeps it off the page footer in the static
export, so it does not show readers a link to a category page the export does
not include.

WikvenFailOnCategories in .wikven.yaml names this category, so a build that puts
a page in it stops and says which pages did.
